Load the ACE-Step components at their target dtype to avoid temporary fp32 allocations. The VAE
uses the same dtype value for loading and placement; the DiT loader already applies its dtype.
Inactive proposal: this patch is not in apply-overlay.sh or verified by verify-overlay.py.
